6e19d4366aa95d2d8b61bb91e7"}, {"event_type": "agent.input", "trace_id": "a0114c5f88df453c", "span_id": "be4afb7c124f439b", "parent_span_id": null, "span_name": "defect-analyst", "sequence_id": 12, "timestamp_ns": 1784073870455538000, "payload": {"framework": "strands", "agent_name": "defect-analyst", "model": "gpt-4o-mini", "input": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Context:\nHandoff Message: Report DR-3391 indicates 6% of TX-90 gearbox housings show hairline cracks at the mounting boss after the press-fit bearing insertion station; please investigate the root cause and disposition today's affected run.\n\nUser Request: Defect report DR-3391 (assembly line 4): 6% of TX-90 gearbox housings from today's run show hairline cracks at the mounting boss. The boss wall is die-cast A380 aluminum; the cracks appear only after the press-fit bearing insertion station. Determine the root cause, disposition today's affected run, and recommend a fix.\n\nPrevious agents who worked on this: intake-coordinator\n\nOther agents available for collaboration:\nAgent name: intake-coordinator.\nAgent name: corrective-action-engineer.\n\nYou have access to swarm coordination tools if you need help from other agents. If you don't hand off to another agent, the swarm will consider the task complete.\n\n"}]}]}, "hash": "sha256:b6d3aa21443b7dda40d65cffbb839d0e0b34f81a1c5cf7eee762d3c03c975a95", "previous_hash": "sha256:1cf2dd9c5da4a26666c56d3c980c7acce6dfa024382efb158e80db3e36c7f744"}, {"event_type": "model.invoke", "trace_id": "a0114c5f88df453c", "span_id": "4b91be9eddd54801", "parent_span_id": "be4afb7c124f439b", "span_name": null, "sequence_id": 13, "timestamp_ns": 1784073873721722000, "payload": {"framework": "strands", "agent_name": "defect-analyst", "model": "gpt-4o-mini", "latency_ms": 3265.462, "stop_reason": "tool_use"}, "hash": "sha256:aff13b145fc04360bfc7c1c2c7b084d542b089597cf6b064cd7c5997ceaba899", "previous_hash": "sha256:b6d3aa21443b7dda40d65cffbb839d0e0b34f81a1c5cf7eee762d3c